WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Manon dashes as Ryu falls from heavy Rond-point.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.650
The Drive Rush crouching medium punch is blocked.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.150
Back heavy punch hits after the blocked medium.

4
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.750
Medium Renversé follows the connected back heavy punch.

5
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.450
Renversé throws Ryu down and raises the medal count from one to two.
